<h1>Wheelhouse</h1>

<p>Wheelhouse is a neighborhood bike repair shop. We fix bikes properly, tell you what a job costs before we start, and give you a promised-ready date when you drop your bike off.</p>

<p>Find your way around:</p>

<ul>
  <li><%= link_to "Services & prices", services_path %> — every job we do and what it costs.</li>
  <li><%= link_to "Visiting the workshop", visiting_path %> — where we are, when we're open, and what happens when you bring a bike in.</li>
  <li><%= link_to "About", about_path %> — who runs the shop.</li>
</ul>
